# Peugeot 205 five-door hatchback, 1983-1998.
#
# The 205 that rescued Peugeot: 3,707 mm long, 1,572 mm wide, 1,350 mm high,
# 2,420 mm wheelbase; 1.0-1.9 petrol and 1.8 diesel, plus the GTI. European Car
# of the Year 1984 and a top seller in Britain through the late 1980s and 1990s.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peugeot_205
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Peugeot colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 220 in total (white 60, red 60, blue 55, grey 45).
#
# Speed 160 km/h; comfort 70/285 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1983-1998 with a road tail to about 2006.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/peugeot-205.blend. References:
# citycars/references/peugeot-205/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
